
@startuml
title Passport Automation System - Component Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor Applicant

component "Applicant Interface" as UI
component "Passport Management Module" as PMS
component "Verification Module" as VM
component "Passport Issuance Module" as IM
database "Passport Database" as DB

Applicant --> UI : Uses
UI --> PMS : Submit application
PMS --> VM : Verify details and proofs
VM --> DB : Read applicant records
VM --> PMS : Verification result
PMS --> IM : Approved application
IM --> DB : Save passport details
PMS --> DB : Store application and status

@enduml
